@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Proposed external attempt, stale worker and unknown-effect reconciliation
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

participant Dispatcher as D
database "Durable intent / claim / observation" as DB
participant "Scoped worker" as W
participant "External facility" as E
participant Reconciler as R
D -> DB : discover committed pending intent
D -> W : eligible identified work (delivery may duplicate)
W -> DB : atomic claim + generation; verify current scope
DB --> W : exact admitted attempt / current claim
W -> E : intended external operation / actual supported identity
E ->x W : response lost after possible effect
W -> DB : record unknown evidence under current generation if valid
R -> DB : resolve expired / uncertain attempt; claim reconciliation
R -> E : query same attributable effect where actually supported
E --> R : confirmed / no-effect / partial / still unknown evidence
R -> DB : guarded observation; preserve unresolved scope
note over W,R
 Lease expiry does not stop an old worker or prove no external effect.
 Local fencing rejects stale writes; it cannot undo remote action.
 No blind resend, relaunch or redeploy; unsupported lookup retains uncertainty.
end note
@enduml
